          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kunangwa lidiku lialondaku Musa yavolera avandu, “Mumali kokora uvwoni ovonene ligali. Navuzwa kalunu ndanigira kuzia mukigulu ku Yahova; mbula ndanyoora lisamiifwa kigira vwoni vwinyu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musa yirana ku Yahova navoora, “Avandu yava vamali kokora uvwoni vonene ligali, na velombeeye umunyasaye wizahabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EXO 32:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Navuzwa kalunu nuuva nuyanza kuvasamiiha uvwoni vwavo, nigataveeye ndio, ngusaala, mwaza, utulizi lieta liange mu kitabu chicho cha waang'oda mu mita ga vandu vovo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EXO.32.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
